  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Allow Quest users to activate a setting in the options menu, enabling access to PC-exclusive content, accompanied by a warning prompt before activation. Also could have it where the settings could be hidden until the warning is accepted. Maybe a different UI to match PC?\n\n----------------------------------------------------------\n\n     Your about to enable PC Settings!\n\nPC content wasn't meant for quest because of the low specks. This could lead to crashes or undesired gameplay.\n\n· PC avatars enabled\n\n· PC effects\n\n· Other PC settings\n\nAre you sere?",
